      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "圆周和直线相交于点$A(-8,6)$和$B(6,-8)$. 每一个交",
        "点的坐标既是方程组的第一个方程的解，又是第二个方程的",
        "解，也就是方程组的解."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，方程组（1）有两个解：",
        "$(-8,6)$和$(6,-8)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在我们不用图解法来解同一个方程组."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在第二个方程中，用变量$y$表示变量$x$后，得到：",
        "$x=-2-y$."
      ]
